  "notes": "L3 exists only in the East wing; westCourt/aeon/parkson absent. Parking Zone G (grey band x450-712, y135-207) excluded. Coordinates read from 4x-16x gridded zooms of the 750x650 crop, \u00b15-10 px. UNK-1: unlabeled red block (x239-268, y212-262) hanging below IOI Grand's SW corner, separated from it by a thin line; may actually be part of IOI Grand (2AT-3A) or of Maharaja Karaoke. Maharaja polygon includes the narrow red strip (x226-239) that links it to Rollerwa around the pale-background notch. Believe Fitness sublabel is unreadable at source resolution (3 digits at x228-240,y372-379); '229' taken from the brief. The small red box at x285-327,y300-317 prints two labels: '227' (left) and a second one that reads like '229' or '228' (right, traced as UNK-2 '?') - it conflicts with Believe Fitness '229', so one of the two is wrong. The faint divider at x300 splitting that box into two units is a judgement call. 228A: only a label tag is printed at x311-330,y363-378 on the dark Believe Fitness block; its unit boundary (x303-340) is estimated. Red block 201-206: column dividers at x401/419/436/455 approximate; '205 & 206' is the two-line label at the block's east end. Dark block 207-211: 207/208 are the shorter west part (y223-248), 209-211 the taller east part (y210-250); label-to-column mapping is by order. Red block SE of court prints five labels 216 217 218 219 220 (last two may be a single '219 & 220'); dividers approximate. Kiosks are red dots; labels K201 (west of court) and K202/K203 (south) are read from the board, while the north dot (K205) and unlabeled east dot (K204) are assigned by elimination from the K201-K205 series. GSC East / JJ Banquet share the yellow fill; the seam at x~585-598 and JJ's north boundary at y290 are read from a faint line and the lift notch. Corridor west end is a dead-end pocket at ~(252,264); the east end is the lift lobby at (595,316). Amenity kinds: 'escalator' with label 'Staircase icon' marks a stairs symbol."
}